1
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,760
If it isn't

2
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,760
the high and mighty Battalion Commander Guo.

3
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,800
Don't kick a man when he's down.

4
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,000
How could I?

5
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,920
I just happened to be passing by

6
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:50,040
and saw you.

7
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,360
Looks like you're carrying a lot.

8
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,760
What's your point?

9
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,480
What can I say?

10
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,000
How does that saying go again?

11
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:03,400
The end of the road for a hero.

12
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,400
Funny, to me it feels like

13
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,600
a new lease on life.

14
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:26,720
Battalion Commander.

15
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:27,760
Are we leaving?

16
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,000
Where to?

17
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,120
Let's go back.

18
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,560
Don't tell me

19
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,560
you came here specifically to see the 1st Battalion Commander off.

20
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,320
I did.

21
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,600
I'm actually a bit sad to see him go.

22
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
I've lost a good rival.

23
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,320
Have a seat.

24
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,080
Captain Wang.

25
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,600
I'm now a soldier in your Training Unit.

26
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,760
Whatever the task is,

27
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,560
just assign it.

28
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,920
You're too polite, Battalion Commander Guo.

29
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,640
I'm no longer a battalion commander.

30
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:01,680
Just call me Xiao Guo.

31
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,440
Lao Guo.

32
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,400
Right now,

33
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:09,000
I actually do have a tough problem.

34
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,000
Go ahead.

35
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,720
Isn't this to implement

36
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,840
the Group Army's Infantry Specialization requirements?

37
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,480
The brigade specially organized a session

38
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:19,480
for the technical backbone of the Reconnaissance Specialty

39
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,200
to train here.

40
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:22,200
They are mostly recruits,

41
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,840
focusing mainly on new skills and electronic information.

42
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,000
Actually,

43
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,600
once they return to their respective battalions,

44
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,480
they'll still need to be guided by veterans.

45
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:32,080
So it's just about basics and laying the groundwork.

46
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,040
Captain Wang,

47
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,000
forgive me for speaking out of turn.

48
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,760
But since

49
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,880
this backbone training was organized,

50
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,680
it must achieve its purpose.

51
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,480
Otherwise,

52
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,880
it'll be hard to meet

53
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,360
the Group Army's needs.

54
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,440
You hit the nail on the head.

55
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:50,720
The Group Army specifically set a standard

56
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,600
for this training.

57
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,480
After the training ends,

58
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,800
there will be spot-check assessments.

59
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,560
But up until now,

60
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,840
they haven't allocated any instructors to me.

61
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,800
Right now, it's a case of

62
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,040
"You can't make bricks without straw."

63
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:04,400
Tell me,

64
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,800
what do you need me to do?

65
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,600
I don't care what you do,

66
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,760
as long as they pass the superiors' assessment.

67
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,320
Of course,

68
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,040
if they can bring back a good ranking,

69
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:15,800
that would be even better.

70
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,680
All right, I'll try.

71
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,120
Don't just try.

72
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:20,920
How about this?

73
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,200
This training team

74
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:24,240
will be under your full command from now on.

75
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,280
Rest assured,

76
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,160
the unit leadership will absolutely not interfere.

77
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:28,760
Naturally,

78
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,920
we won't let you fight alone either.

79
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,480
I've assigned you an assistant.

80
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:34,640
Yang Maolin!

81
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,640
Here!

82
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,240
Starting today,

83
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,720
all your work

84
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,760
will be overseen by Battalion Commander Guo.

85
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,000
No,

86
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:47,960
by Captain Guo.

87
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,440
Captain Guo?

88
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,320
What is it?

89
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,040
Didn't you hear me clearly?

90
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,280
From now on,

91
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,640
Comrade Guo Zijian

92
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,360
is our 396th Brigade Training Unit's

93
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,040
Special Operations Training Team Captain.

94
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,200
Understood.

95
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:04,440
From now on, all my work

96
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,320
will be strictly under Captain Guo's orders.

97
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:07,720
Lao Guo,

98
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,200
you two get acquainted.

99
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,440
I'll have someone bring

100
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,440
the materials over to you later.

101
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,960
I have something to do, so I'll step out.

102
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:13,480
Okay.

103
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:19,560
Captain Guo,

104
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,040
how will my work be assigned?

105
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,040
We'll talk about it later.

106
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,240
Guo Zijian.

107
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,560
He's actually being quite obedient this time.

108
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,240
He packed his rucksack on his own

109
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,440
and reported to the Training Unit.

110
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,720
We were all young once.

111
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,840
I just hope that this time, he can

112
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,840
calm down and seriously reflect,

113
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,240
learn his lesson,

114
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,320
and reinvent himself.

115
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,040
Young.

116
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,760
Commissar,

117
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,960
don't take his personality issues

118
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,000
and generalize them.

119
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,960
It won't help him grow.

120
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,720
Why are you nitpicking my words?

121
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,120
Anyway, I just think

122
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,400
it's a case of "Spare the rod

123
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,160
and spoil the child."

124
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,680
In the remote woods of the Training Unit,

125
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,960
how is he going to act out?

126
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,000
Don't forget,

127
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,200
Yang Maolin is there.

128
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,520
He caused a scene at the party committee for Wu Dongsheng.

129
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,040
If he runs into Yang Maolin,

130
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,440
I'm afraid

131
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,800
he might cause serious trouble.

132
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,080
Then he's exactly like the saying,

133
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,720
"He aches all over

134
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,000
if he's not beaten for three days."

135
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,560
If Guo Zijian

136
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,520
still can't get over this mental block,

137
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,600
and can't overcome this hurdle,

138
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:15,200
then don't blame us for writing him off.

139
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,800
I'll just have him

140
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,400
sent back to the Infantry Academy

141
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,040
to act out there.

142
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,040
Commissar,

143
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,880
don't speak too soon.

144
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:32,840
Here are

145
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:34,880
all the personal profiles of the trainees in this batch.

146
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,840
Dongfang Qingtian.

147
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,400
Drones.

148
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,280
The command and operation of drones

149
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:49,080
mainly rely on radio remote control equipment

150
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:52,240
and built-in program control devices

151
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,000
to function.

152
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,800
Although they lack a cockpit,

153
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,400
the available space

154
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:58,600
is equipped with an autopilot,

155
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,520
program control devices, and other systems.

156
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,280
As drones fly up in the sky,

157
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,000
well,

158
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,200
how do we keep these kites from losing their strings?

159
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,360
Actually, we can rely on ground stations,

160
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,120
naval vessels,

161
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,360
mother aircraft remote station personnel,

162
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,640
as well as radar equipment,

163
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,360
to track them.

164
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,800
What are you doing standing at my door?

165
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,600
Please give me an assignment, Captain.

166
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,760
What was your name again?

167
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,760
Yang Maolin.

168
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:43,080
Shouldn't you be at the 404th Brigade?

169
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,040
I promised Squad Leader Wu...

170
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,920
...to succeed him as the 1st Battalion recon squad leader.

171
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,400
Then you should go to the 1st Battalion.

172
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,800
What are you doing at the Training Unit?

173
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:50,960
I obey the organization's orders.

174
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,080
You obey the organization's orders?

175
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,440
Then how come I heard...

176
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,920
...you wrote a letter in blood to Deputy Commander Liang?

177
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,680
I promised Squad Leader Wu.

178
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,720
Is it up to Squad Leader Wu to make you squad leader?

179
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,520
I will work hard.

180
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,080
Work hard at what?

181
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,240
As it stands,

182
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,560
you're a long way from being a recon squad leader.

183
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,680
I will work hard.

184
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:15,960
How will you work hard?

185
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,120
How?

186
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,040
Go wait somewhere else.

187
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,080
Don't stand at my door.

188
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,840
Please assign me a task, Captain.

189
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,880
If you really have nothing to do,

190
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,320
go to the woods behind the Training Unit

191
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,280
to scout the terrain.

192
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,320
Yes, sir.

193
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:03,800
Blockhead.

194
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,760
What are you doing?

195
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,920
Dongfang Qingtian!

196
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,160
What did I just say?

197
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,240
You just said...

198
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:28,440
Say it.

199
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:30,800
Drones.

200
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,320
And then?

201
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:34,480
And then...

202
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:39,280
they're like kites.

203
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:44,080
There's a string holding them from the ground.

204
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:46,200
Otherwise, they easily get lost.

205
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:50,880
Alright.

206
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:52,080
Good deduction.

207
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:53,680
Then tell me,

208
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,760
how do we keep our kite string from breaking?

209
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,880
Via ground stations,

210
00:11:59,280 --> 00:11:59,880
naval vessels,

211
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:01,800
mother aircraft remote station personnel,

212
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,400
and radar equipment,

213
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,240
we conduct

214
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,480
tracking, positioning,

215
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,840
remote control, telemetry,

216
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,680
and digital transmission for the drones.

217
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,800
What is the operational scope of drones?

218
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,760
Military applications include

219
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,720
aerial reconnaissance, surveillance,

220
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,200
communication, anti-submarine warfare,

221
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,360
and electronic jamming.

222
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:18,760
In recent years,

223
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,360
drones in military operations

224
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,560
have seen continuous expansion.

225
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,240
For example...

226
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,040
Don't stray too far.

227
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,680
Let me ask you,

228
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,640
how is drone control categorized?

229
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,000
Instructor, sir.

230
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,800
Your question isn't precise enough.

231
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:33,040
Drone control is divided into self-control,

232
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:34,800
benign control, and malicious control.

233
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,840
In the interest of time,

234
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,760
I'll just discuss drone countermeasures

235
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,560
and their technical classifications.

236
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,560
Broadly speaking,

237
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,200
first is radio jamming;

238
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:42,560
second is net capture technology;

239
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,200
third is hard-kill technology;

240
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,640
fourth is laser strike technology;

241
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:46,600
fifth is high-energy...

242
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,360
Dongfang Qingtian!

243
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,880
You think because you memorized the textbook,

244
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:52,360
you've truly mastered drone technology?

245
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,840
Instructor, sir.

246
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,160
I don't need to memorize the textbook.

247
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,120
If we're talking about operation,

248
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,360
I don't know which model you mean.

249
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,760
Do you mean large drones,

250
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:01,720
small drones,

251
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,400
or micro drones?

252
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,800
Dongfang Qingtian,

253
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,040
you're really something.

254
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,200
I think for this drone class,

255
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,000
you might as well teach it.

256
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,080
Captain Guo,

257
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,800
you just took office.

258
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,120
I shouldn't give you this headache,

259
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,000
but this class...

260
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,480
I just can't teach it anymore.

261
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,040
Let whoever is capable take over.

262
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,400
I've taught so many classes,

263
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:46,320
but I've never seen anything like today.

264
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:47,800
They have absolutely no discipline.

265
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,080
They're completely disrespectful!

266
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,160
Instructor Shao,

267
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,760
calm down first.

268
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:55,600
This batch of trainees is too hard to manage.

269
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,120
I'd rather go back to my company

270
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:57,960
and be a platoon leader.

271
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,560
If you go back to your original unit,

272
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,280
how will I write your appraisal report?

273
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,080
I...

274
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,720
So don't worry about it for now.

275
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,880
I'll sort this out for you.

276
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:15,240
Thank you, Captain Guo.

277
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:25,920
With approval from our superiors,

278
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,840
we are holding two combat matches today.

279
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:29,480
Dongfang Qingtian!

280
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,160
Here!

281
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,320
So it's you.

282
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,360
Reporting, Captain!

283
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,160
Yes!

284
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,600
Since you were sleeping in class

285
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,640
instead of paying attention,

286
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:43,400
that means you're very confident

287
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:44,280
in your drone operation.

288
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,720
Dare to compete against Instructor Shao?

289
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,480
That's not a good idea, Captain.

290
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,400
It'll be awkward.

291
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,520
Cut the crap!

292
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,360
Today we'll do something simple.

293
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:58,880
One-on-one.

294
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,080
Air-to-Air Combat.

295
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,680
Do you all want to see this?

296
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,920
Yes!

297
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,360
Captain.

298
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,360
I won.

299
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:25,920
Who said you won?

300
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,600
I told you to compete against Instructor Shao.

301
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,120
I didn't say it was just one round.

302
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,160
Fall in. Move out.

303
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:33,080
Yes, sir.

304
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:34,720
Second event,

305
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:37,520
IFV off-road driving.

306
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,040
What?

307
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,200
Can't drive it?

308
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,000
Dongfang Qingtian!

309
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:21,440
Here!

310
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:25,520
Instructor Shao is the scout platoon leader of the Third Battalion.

311
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,440
When it comes to various infantry fighting vehicles,

312
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,000
armored and reconnaissance vehicles,

313
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,120
from their overall performance

314
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,960
down to a single screw,

315
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,160
he knows them inside out.

316
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,000
And he can operate them with ease.

317
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:44,640
I know that those of you selected

318
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:46,160
to participate in the special ops training

319
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,240
are definitely the cream of the crop

320
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,800
among the new recruits from every battalion and company.

321
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,400
Some of you even,

322
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,920
in certain areas,

323
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:55,400
possess extraordinary talent and abilities.

324
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:57,800
But everyone has their strengths

325
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:58,920
and their weaknesses.

326
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,800
I believe that here in the training team,

327
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,760
as long as you learn with an open mind

328
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,640
and train like your life depends on it,

329
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,840
you will definitely gain a lot.

330
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:08,800
Captain.

331
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:10,400
I was wrong.

332
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,400
Instructor Shao.

333
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:15,280
I'm sorry.

334
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,360
I will definitely fix my attitude from now on.

335
00:19:17,760 --> 00:19:19,000
I don't need your apology,

336
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,680
but I do need you to complete a task.

337
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:23,760
Just say the word, Captain.

338
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,160
Starting today,

339
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,920
I'm putting you in charge of the drone course.

340
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:31,800
Instructor Shao.

341
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:34,480
From now on, the special vehicles course

342
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,440
is in your hands.

343
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:38,760
If these fresh recruits don't behave,

344
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,320
just give them hell.

345
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:42,880
By the time they graduate,

346
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:44,880
I hope they can all meet the highest standards.

347
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,000
Yes, sir!

348
00:20:12,280 --> 00:20:12,840
Captain.

349
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:13,720
I...

350
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,760
I really don't know what to say.

351
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,080
Not angry anymore?

352
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,640
To be honest,

353
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,280
when you first had me compete with him in drones,

354
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:24,560
I was really mad.

355
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,600
But later,

356
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,240
I understood your intentions.

357
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:29,320
I concede.

358
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:33,320
I completely understand how you feel.

359
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:34,840
As an instructor,

360
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:37,120
being challenged by a trainee in class

361
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:38,000
is quite embarrassing.

362
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:40,560
But this Dongfang Qingtian,

363
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:42,560
he's a drone fanatic.

364
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:43,520
In this field,

365
00:20:43,520 --> 00:20:44,280
let alone you,

366
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,840
even in the entire Training Unit,

367
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:47,040
no one can beat him.

368
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:48,080
Myself included.

369
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,240
I've come to terms with it.

370
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:51,760
I'm glad you have.

371
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,000
Here.

372
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:01,120
This is a set of military teaching materials.

373
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,160
Texts,

374
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:02,760
videos,

375
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:03,160
it has them all.

376
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,080
The subjects are comprehensive.

377
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:04,840
You'll probably need this.

378
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Captain, I...

379
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,200
As instructors,

380
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,080
we must admit our shortcomings

381
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,720
and expand our knowledge.

382
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:13,040
That's how trainees will respect you.

383
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:15,040
Acting out of spite solves nothing.

384
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:20,120
Captain Guo.

385
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:21,200
Thank you.

386
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,040
You're welcome.

387
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,240
Study hard.

388
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,120
I'm looking forward to your class.

389
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:25,080
Okay.

390
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:54,320
Report.

391
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:55,120
Come in.

392
00:21:56,760 --> 00:21:57,200
Captain.

393
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:58,840
Lights out is in half an hour.

394
00:21:58,840 --> 00:22:00,400
Yang Maolin still hasn't come back.

395
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:01,360
