396
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:06,560
Oh no.

397
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,400
Could he still be in the mountains?

398
00:22:09,840 --> 00:22:10,280
Let's go.

399
00:22:20,760 --> 00:22:22,040
You know, this Guo Zijian,

400
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:23,880
