401
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:24,880
He hasn't even settled in yet,

402
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,360
and he's already given me a hard time twice.

403
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,200
The mountains and forests here are so dense.

404
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:33,000
If something really happens to Yang Maolin...

405
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:33,680
Captain,

406
00:22:34,120 --> 00:22:35,160
