407
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,600
Yang Maolin is a special ops veteran.

408
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,640
He has extensive wilderness survival experience.

409
00:22:40,560 --> 00:22:41,120
Besides,

410
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:42,160
even though it's a deep forest,

411
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,600
it's still within our camp boundaries.

412
00:22:45,520 --> 00:22:46,200
Maybe

413
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:47,160
he isn't familiar with the way

414
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,040
and got lost somewhere.

415
00:22:48,560 --> 00:22:50,280
We've checked the security cameras twice

416
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:52,080
and haven't caught a single glimpse of him.

417
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:58,040
I heard

418
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,840
Old Guo has been very cold to Yang Maolin.

419
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:04,840
And Wu Dongsheng is caught in the middle.

420
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:05,880
Do you think maybe...

421
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,400
Stop overthinking it.

422
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:12,440
This Old Guo, seriously...

423
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:14,640
Then in this situation,

424
00:23:15,120 --> 00:23:16,160
should we report it or not?

425
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:19,720
Before lights out,

426
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,280
if there's still no news,

427
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:22,800
we must report it.

428
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:23,880
Check camera two.

429
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:29,840
Camera four.

430
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,200
Reporting, Yang Maolin is back.

431
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:03,440
Let's go.

432
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:13,520
Reporting.

433
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,200
Yang Maolin was ordered to scout the terrain.

434
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:17,040
I have completed the reconnaissance of

435
00:24:17,040 --> 00:24:18,560
key targets south of Xiangsi Cliff.

436
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,160
Awaiting orders.

437
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,200
What is this supposed to mean?

438
00:24:22,040 --> 00:24:23,200
Are you trying to make me look bad,

439
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:24,960
or just putting on a show for me?

440
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:26,960
I'm not making you look bad,

441
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:28,280
and I don't put on shows.

442
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:31,880
Your timing is so precise,

443
00:24:32,520 --> 00:24:33,760
and you say you're not putting on a show?

444
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:35,600
My task was specifically timed

445
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:38,320
to be carried out at lights out.

446
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:40,760
Since you're working so selflessly,

447
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,480
you must be hungry.

448
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:43,200
Captain,

449
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:44,040
before I set out,

450
00:24:44,040 --> 00:24:45,800
I brought enough rations for 48 hours.

451
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:53,240
Fall in.

452
00:24:53,320 --> 00:24:53,800
Yes, sir.

453
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,240
Where are you off to now?

454
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:24,880
Report!

455
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:27,320
The reconnaissance mission is not yet complete.

456
00:25:27,720 --> 00:25:28,640
Today's objective

457
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:30,520
is the main target point north of Xiangsi Cliff.

458
00:25:32,720 --> 00:25:33,440
There's no need to go.

459
00:25:33,560 --> 00:25:34,280
Captain, sir.

460
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:35,920
We can't abandon a mission halfway.

461
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,360
You must return before dark.

462
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:39,920
Yes, sir!

463
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:50,080
Instructor!

464
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:53,800
Instructor! Instructor!

465
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:54,680
Good news!

466
00:25:54,840 --> 00:25:55,840
Fantastic news!

467
00:25:57,760 --> 00:25:58,840
What fantastic news

468
00:25:58,840 --> 00:25:59,920
has you so excited?

469
00:25:59,920 --> 00:26:01,040
Don't shout yourself hoarse.

470
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,640
The Group Army Staff Department

471
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,560
forwarded the Battalion Commander's exercise review.

472
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:06,600
They even added a long commentary.

473
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:08,440
Look.

474
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:13,280
Beautiful.

475
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,000
Beautiful.

476
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:30,200
What's wrong?

477
00:26:32,280 --> 00:26:33,560
Talk about being too late.

478
00:26:35,360 --> 00:26:36,720
Getting this thing now...

479
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:40,840
What's the point anymore?

480
00:26:53,280 --> 00:26:53,760
Report!

481
00:26:58,560 --> 00:26:59,040
Battalion Commander!

482
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,120
The Group Army headquarters

483
00:27:01,120 --> 00:27:02,760
forwarded Battalion Commander Guo's exercise review,

484
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:04,600
requiring all company-level and above commanders

485
00:27:04,600 --> 00:27:05,560
to study it carefully.

486
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,640
This Guo Zijian...

487
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:10,560
Didn't he go to the Training Unit as an instructor?

488
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,600
Pulling a stunt like this,

489
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:14,040
