490
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:15,520
Tell me,

491
00:27:15,880 --> 00:27:17,400
could this be a signal?

492
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:22,480
The timing is wrong.

493
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:24,320
If it were a signal,

494
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:26,720
it shouldn't be sent now.

495
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:28,520
True.

496
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:30,400
Then I guess it's probably

497
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,200
just a simple study document.

498
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,400
This is bizarre.

499
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:39,320
Guo Zijian

500
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:41,800
was demoted to the Training Unit,

501
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:44,920
so how can he still cause such a stir?

502
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:47,360
Report!

503
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:48,320
Come in.

504
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,080
Speak.

505
00:27:58,320 --> 00:27:59,520
Terrain reconnaissance complete.

506
00:27:59,520 --> 00:28:01,400
Controllable land within the Training Unit

507
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:02,760
is 89 square kilometers.

508
00:28:03,120 --> 00:28:05,480
78 various fortification facilities,

509
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:07,440
and 25 training monitoring points.

510
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:08,840
Their azimuths, coordinates,

511
00:28:08,840 --> 00:28:09,880
names, and purposes

512
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,720
have all been mastered.

513
00:28:11,280 --> 00:28:13,120
The Training Unit has internal maps.

514
00:28:13,520 --> 00:28:14,720
Maps are static.

515
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:20,960
So you're saying you're dynamic.

516
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:23,880
Tell me,

517
00:28:24,560 --> 00:28:25,760
how exactly are you dynamic?

518
00:28:26,720 --> 00:28:28,120
It's just different.

519
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:31,640
Alright.

520
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:32,320
Dismissed.

521
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:39,680
What?

522
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:42,160
Expecting me to invite you for tea?

523
00:28:42,440 --> 00:28:43,760
There is another important matter

524
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,080
I need to report to you.

525
00:28:45,800 --> 00:28:46,360
Speak.

526
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:48,400
The Yunfeng Mountains behind the training ground

527
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:50,280
are covered with dense forests

528
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,200
and rugged peaks.

529
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:53,080
They haven't been developed for tourism yet,

530
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:54,880
so their training potential is huge.

531
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:04,560
This task,

532
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:07,080
did you do it all by yourself from start to finish?

533
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,160
The captain assigned me to do it alone.

534
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,240
You mean to say,

535
00:29:10,240 --> 00:29:12,760
all the terrain and landforms within the Training Unit's area,

536
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:13,880
you know them inside out?

537
00:29:14,120 --> 00:29:14,680
Yes.

538
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:15,640
Including at night?

539
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:16,560
Including at night.

540
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:55,800
Can I trust you?

541
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:58,800
Yes.

542
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:01,160
Good.

543
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,240
Go back and draft a

544
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:05,160
selection and training plan for the special ops team.

545
00:30:05,600 --> 00:30:06,720
Submit it to me when it's done.

546
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:10,560
Any questions?

547
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:12,320
No.

548
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:14,280
Dismissed.

549
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:15,600
Yes, sir.

550
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:32,920
Emergency assembly!

551
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:12,920
Hurry!

552
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:30,040
Hurry!

553
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:34,720
Dress right, dress!

554
00:31:37,120 --> 00:31:38,200
Eyes front!

555
00:31:39,280 --> 00:31:39,920
At ease!

556
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,160
Attention!

557
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:48,520
Comrade Captain,

558
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:50,040
the unit is assembled.

559
00:31:50,280 --> 00:31:50,960
Awaiting your orders.

560
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:52,040
At ease.

561
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:52,760
Yes, sir.

562
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:57,560
At ease!

563
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:09,680
Listen up.

564
00:32:12,520 --> 00:32:13,600
Eight minutes.

565
00:32:14,600 --> 00:32:16,040
At this speed,

566
00:32:16,320 --> 00:32:17,920
the enemy will be at your door

567
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:19,280
while you're still pulling up your pants.

568
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:22,720
Let me tell you,

569
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:25,280
starting today,

570
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:27,720
