574
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,280
and leave,

575
00:32:34,840 --> 00:32:37,120
so you don't embarrass the Special Ops Team later.

576
00:32:46,760 --> 00:32:47,600
I know

577
00:32:49,520 --> 00:32:51,040
some of you might think

578
00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:52,560
you're technical specialists,

579
00:32:53,080 --> 00:32:54,480
technical reconnaissance soldiers.

580
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:58,080
But I want to ask everyone here,

581
00:32:58,760 --> 00:33:00,000
is anyone willing

582
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,920
to be taken prisoner on the battlefield?

583
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:02,840
No!

584
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:03,880
I can't hear you!

585
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:04,760
No!

586
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:05,640
Good.

587
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:07,520
Since none of you are,

588
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:10,560
then in the upcoming field training,

589
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:11,920
I don't want to see you

590
00:33:12,320 --> 00:33:13,920
whining and crying

591
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:14,880
and making fools of yourselves.

592
00:33:17,760 --> 00:33:19,400
There are thirty of you now.

593
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:22,600
After the first phase of field training,

594
00:33:23,520 --> 00:33:24,840
only twelve of you

595
00:33:25,120 --> 00:33:26,640
will have the opportunity to join

596
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:28,640
the extra special field training

597
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:31,280
and become the best of the best.

598
00:33:31,760 --> 00:33:32,560
Now,

599
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,840
you have five minutes

600
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,320
to prepare

601
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:38,520
all your gear for the upcoming field training.

602
00:33:39,360 --> 00:33:40,040
Dismissed!

603
00:35:16,680 --> 00:35:17,840
The recent training,

604
00:35:18,680 --> 00:35:20,520
due to safety concerns,

605
00:35:21,040 --> 00:35:24,160
was only at 50% intensity of regular infantry training.

606
00:35:25,200 --> 00:35:27,840
Compared to standard Infantry Specialization training,

607
00:35:27,880 --> 00:35:29,680
it's still miles behind.

608
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:33,640
So, for those who passed the assessment,

609
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:35,960
don't think you're anything special.

610
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:38,000
Like I said,

611
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,400
only twelve of you

612
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,960
will have the chance to join

613
00:35:42,040 --> 00:35:44,000
the extra special field training.

614
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,640
For those who weren't selected,

615
00:35:46,520 --> 00:35:48,000
it's not that you're not good enough,

616
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:50,360
but the special ops members I want

617
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:52,360
must be more

618
00:35:52,560 --> 00:35:53,760
than just excellent.

619
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:55,880
But as for these twelve people,

620
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:57,560
don't celebrate just yet.

621
00:35:58,000 --> 00:35:59,960
Because in the upcoming training,

622
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:01,920
my goal

623
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:03,160
is to keep half,

624
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:04,560
or even fewer.

625
00:36:10,480 --> 00:36:11,120
Now,

626
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:13,000
Squad Leader Yang

627
00:36:13,160 --> 00:36:14,560
will announce the twelve names.

628
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,120
Niu Quanfu!

629
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:18,760
Here!

630
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:19,480
I didn't expect

631
00:36:20,080 --> 00:36:21,240
them to look this decent.

632
00:36:22,560 --> 00:36:23,320
Who knows,

633
00:36:24,320 --> 00:36:25,960
he might actually make something out of this.

634
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:27,080
Ma Zhengzheng!

635
00:36:27,280 --> 00:36:28,000
Here!

636
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:29,320
Dong Wenbo!

637
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:29,960
Here!

638
00:36:32,120 --> 00:36:33,880
I gave you three days

639
00:36:34,040 --> 00:36:36,040
to carefully study the training plan,

640
00:36:36,080 --> 00:36:37,720
and this is what you give me?

641
00:36:38,240 --> 00:36:39,600
If judged by standard,

642
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:41,840
systematic training evaluation criteria,

643
00:36:42,120 --> 00:36:44,360
this doesn't even qualify as entry-level.

644
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:44,760
I just...

645
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:45,720
You just what?

646
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,800
I know you have great overall qualities.

647
00:36:54,240 --> 00:36:55,480
To say you're one in a million

648
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,240
wouldn't be an exaggeration.

649
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:59,080
But your initiative

650
00:36:59,080 --> 00:37:00,480
and tactical creativity

651
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:01,480
are still far from enough.

652
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:06,240
If you settle for this,

653
00:37:06,560 --> 00:37:07,880
let me tell you, Yang Maolin,

654
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:08,840
what awaits you

655
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:10,520
won't be becoming the next King of Soldiers,

656
00:37:10,920 --> 00:37:12,280
but being replaced

657
00:37:12,560 --> 00:37:13,480
and eliminated.

658
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:17,920
See those recruits?

659
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:19,960
Yes, I do.

660
00:37:20,720 --> 00:37:22,200
In certain new fields,

661
00:37:22,720 --> 00:37:23,800
I'm indeed not as good as them.

662
00:37:24,520 --> 00:37:25,560
But I can learn.

663
00:37:25,720 --> 00:37:27,160
Please give me a chance, Captain.

664
00:37:29,680 --> 00:37:30,120
Good.

665
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,360
Having this awareness

666
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:33,520
means there's still hope for you.

667
00:37:41,040 --> 00:37:41,960
Take these back

668
00:37:42,160 --> 00:37:43,120
and study them thoroughly.

669
00:37:43,320 --> 00:37:43,880
Yes, sir.

670
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:04,960
Do you think I'm being too harsh

671
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:06,520
and deliberately targeting you?

672
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,480
No.

673
00:38:10,720 --> 00:38:12,560
Do you know who the previous owner

674
00:38:12,560 --> 00:38:13,240
of these files was?

675
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:14,200
No, I don't.

676
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:17,720
It was your old squad leader, Wu Dongsheng.

677
00:38:31,160 --> 00:38:32,680
When he was in the army,

678
00:38:33,640 --> 00:38:36,200
he never gave up on learning and self-improvement,

679
00:38:37,200 --> 00:38:38,480
and he was never just a

680
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,720
recon squad leader who only

681
00:38:40,120 --> 00:38:41,760
relied on his fists and brute force.

682
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:48,640
When he left the army,

683
00:38:48,640 --> 00:38:49,920
he specifically entrusted me,

684
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:52,920
saying if you came to the 396th Brigade,

685
00:38:54,200 --> 00:38:55,920
I should pass these materials on to you.

686
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:57,240
But,

687
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:00,040
I also needed to judge

688
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:03,080
whether you truly deserve his trust.

689
00:39:09,240 --> 00:39:10,000
Yang Maolin,

690
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:12,800
you've passed.

691
00:39:18,480 --> 00:39:19,680
Squad Leader Wu said

692
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:21,640
that even if he is no longer

693
00:39:21,640 --> 00:39:23,360
the King of Soldiers of the 396th Brigade's 1st Battalion,

694
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:27,400
he still won't give up on his ideals.

695
00:39:28,600 --> 00:39:29,200
Yes.

696
00:39:29,880 --> 00:39:31,600
I will also carry on the squad leader's ideals.

697
00:39:32,680 --> 00:39:33,560
You're wrong.

698
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:35,640
If it's just out of guilt,

699
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:37,080
you really don't have to.

700
00:39:38,120 --> 00:39:40,160
And you have no need to live for someone else.

701
00:39:40,520 --> 00:39:41,160
I'm not.

702
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:42,760
My ideals

703
00:39:42,880 --> 00:39:44,080
and the squad leader's ideals

704
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:45,080
are the same.

705
00:39:46,240 --> 00:39:48,280
Choosing to come to the 396th Brigade

706
00:39:48,920 --> 00:39:49,760
and to the 1st Battalion

707
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:53,040
was a decision I made after careful consideration.

708
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:57,200
Well, you can't go to the 1st Battalion now.

709
00:39:58,040 --> 00:39:58,760
Do you regret it?

710
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:00,720
I don't regret it.

711
00:40:01,520 --> 00:40:02,680
Because I feel that

712
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:03,800
sooner or later,

713
00:40:04,160 --> 00:40:04,720
I will...

714
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:06,960
No,

715
00:40:07,520 --> 00:40:08,400
it's we.

716
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,200
We will all return to the 1st Battalion.

717
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,560
Good.

718
00:40:14,360 --> 00:40:15,040
Captain,

719
00:40:15,240 --> 00:40:17,320
what do we do about our upcoming field training?

720
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:18,960
Yang Maolin.

721
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:19,520
Here!

722
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:21,520
This is the training plan.

723
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:23,080
It starts tonight.

724
00:40:23,160 --> 00:40:24,640
Bring all your gear.

725
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,400
Yes, sir!

726
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:36,800
Captain.

727
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:38,720
Didn't we say we'd train on the south side of Guanxia Ridge?

728
00:40:38,720 --> 00:40:39,800
Why are we up here on the peak?

729
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,680
Are we going to camp here tonight?

730
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:43,640
If we were really at war,

731
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:45,680
and the enemy's action plan changed,

732
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:47,480
would we still stick to our original plan?

733
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:48,560
Besides,

734
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:50,680
forget about camping tonight.

735
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,680
Looks like another sleepless night.

736
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:55,920
Captain!

737
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:56,520
We have a situation.

738
00:40:57,120 --> 00:40:58,160
On the north side of Guanxia Ridge,

739
00:40:58,160 --> 00:40:59,480
I spotted some troop movements.

740
00:40:59,960 --> 00:41:00,680
Comrades.

741
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:04,720
The 404th Brigade's Cross-regional Exercise

742
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,360
originally had nothing to do with

743
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:07,440
our 396th Brigade.

744
00:41:07,680 --> 00:41:09,200
But the Group Army's intention

745
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,840
is to take this opportunity

746
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:11,800
to give the 404th Brigade

747
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:13,880
a chance for a Warm-up exercise.

748
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:14,760
At the same time,

749
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:17,240
it also allows our units not participating in the exercise

750
00:41:17,240 --> 00:41:18,360
to drill our troops.

751
00:41:19,080 --> 00:41:20,160
So, an impromptu notice was given

752
00:41:20,160 --> 00:41:22,880
that along the routes the 404th Brigade will take,

753
00:41:22,960 --> 00:41:24,120
they will arrange one or two

754
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:26,400
three-battalion-scale,

755
00:41:26,520 --> 00:41:27,760
small to medium skirmishes.

756
00:41:28,400 --> 00:41:29,680
Our 396th Brigade

757
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:30,920
is one of them.

758
00:41:32,320 --> 00:41:34,440
Then what is our Training Unit's specific mission?

759
00:41:35,760 --> 00:41:37,760
Behind our Training Unit,

760
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:40,160
a fifty-kilometer radius north of Guanxia Ridge

761
00:41:40,240 --> 00:41:42,360
is the area for this skirmish exercise.

762
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:44,400
Because the Group Army's

763
00:41:44,400 --> 00:41:45,680
notice issued to the brigade

764
00:41:45,680 --> 00:41:47,600
did not specify the exact time

765
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:49,000
and combat details,

766
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,800
the brigade commanders require us

767
00:41:50,800 --> 00:41:52,240
to make full combat preparations,

768
00:41:52,960 --> 00:41:54,240
coordinate some personnel,

769
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:55,960
and cooperate with superiors to complete the mission.

770
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,200
Right now,

771
00:41:58,520 --> 00:41:59,640
the convoys of the 1st and 2nd Battalions

772
00:41:59,640 --> 00:42:00,760
are about to enter the field.

773
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,040
Everyone, hurry up and get ready.

774
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:10,640
Why isn't Guo Zijian here?

775
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,000
He reported to me

776
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:14,240
that he took a squad out for training.

777
00:42:14,520 --> 00:42:15,760
Should we call him back?

778
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:17,440
Where are they training?

779
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:18,920
South side of Guanxia Ridge.

780
00:42:18,920 --> 00:42:19,960
That's not within the exercise area.

781
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:21,240
Then it's fine.

782
00:42:21,720 --> 00:42:22,640
Don't disturb them.

783
00:42:22,640 --> 00:42:23,520
Let them continue their training.

784
00:42:24,240 --> 00:42:25,120
Okay, let's go.

785
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:30,280
Are you sure you saw Lin Yihu?

786
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:30,600
Yes.

787
00:42:30,880 --> 00:42:32,680
They must be conducting Forward Reconnaissance.

788
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:34,840
Also,

789
00:42:36,120 --> 00:42:37,360
don't make me squeeze it out of you.

790
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:38,320
If you have more to say, spit it out.

791
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:40,080
On my way back,

792
00:42:40,320 --> 00:42:41,680
I also discovered tracks of the 404th Brigade's

793
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:42,880
reconnaissance personnel.

794
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:46,000
You scouted it out thoroughly.

795
00:42:47,880 --> 00:42:49,440
It seems our 396th Brigade

796
00:42:50,120 --> 00:42:51,800
is going to fight the 404th Brigade again.
